**Companion files:** `schema.sql` (database), `docker-compose.yml` (local run), `tools/simulate.py` (scheduling benchmark), `tools/planner_check.py` (reference model of the basket rules, randomized test), `02-requirements-checklist.md` (tick off as you build).

